 SAP HANA revision 2.00.079.04. See 3569218 - SAP HANA 2 SPS07 Revision 079.04.  If you are still on SAP HANA 1.0, upgrade to the latest version of SAP HANA 2.0 as SAP HANA 1.0 has reached the end of mainstream maintenance in June 2021. See 2946614 - End-of-Maintenance of SAP HANA 1.0 in the SAP BTP, Neo Environment.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-15\nValid as Of: 2025-05-15\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 889 ---\nComponent: SAPUI5\nEnvironment: ABAP,Cloud Foundry,Kyma,Neo,Other\nTitle: SAPUI5 Distribution 1.136\nDescription: SAPUI5 version 1.136 has been released for UI development and can now be consumed by SAP BTP services. It’s up to the services to determine when they start using the new version.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-14\nValid as Of: 2025-05-15\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 890 ---\nComponent: Cloud Integration for Data Services\nEnvironment: Neo\nTitle: Documentation update only: Deep Inserts for OData Adapter\nDescription: The topic OData Adapter has been updated with a note regarding unsupported deep inserts.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Database and Data Management\nLatest Revision: 2025-05-14\nValid as Of: 2025-05-14\nVersion: 1.0.11.56\n\n", "--- Record 1981 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Monitor Workflow Applications as Tiles in SAP Build Work Zone\nDescription: You can now configure and access the Monitor Process and Workflow Instances and Manage Processes and Workflows applications as tiles in SAP Build Work Zone.For more information, see Configure Monitor Workflows Applications.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-11-06\nValid as Of: 2024-11-06\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 198